                                                "sense_id": "89e2a9fe-86d8-3f7d-a729-4a12da21ea54",
                                                "text": "\"What shall we call it?\" he asked. \"Why should you not take the chance of perpetuating your own name?\" said Summerlee, with his usual touch of acidity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c9f5145-b32c-47c1-b961-9ffad3459894",
                                                "sense_id": "89e2a9fe-86d8-3f7d-a729-4a12da21ea54",
                                                "text": "It was a brave, good speech, a speech from that staunch and strong spirit which lay behind all the acidities and angularities of the old zoologist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
